8. WHILE LOOP

Syntax:

initialization;

while (condition) {

// statements

update;

}

I

You, 15 minutes ago . Uncommitted changes
Example:

int i = 1;

while (i <= 5) {

System.out.println(i);

i++;

}


10. WHEN TO USE WHILE

Use while when the number of iterations is not necessarily known beforehand.

Example:

Keep asking for a PIN until the correct PIN is entered.

int pin = 0;

while (pin != 1234) {

pin = sc.nextInt();

}


11. DO-WHILE LOOP

Syntax:

do {

11

} while (condition);

statements

Example:

int i = 1;

do {

System.out.println(i);

i++;

} while (i <= 5);


